## 4. EV 执行记录与复核绑定

```text
$ python3 scripts/check_evidence.py --adapter tests/fixtures/valid-adapter.json --run docs/reviews/2026-11-08-self-acceptance/07-验收回归清单.md
[OK] EV-01 退出码 0：python3 scripts/selftest.py；输出：... | 结果：5/5 通过
[OK] <repo>/docs/reviews/2026-11-08-self-acceptance/07-验收回归清单.md：6 行，结论=通过（通过 6）

$ cat docs/reviews/2026-11-08-self-acceptance/evidence/ev-runs.log
{"time":"2026-11-08T17:39:39","head":"025ed84436b18bcfff9823217874f083c992f58a","ev":"EV-01","command":"python3 scripts/selftest.py","exit":0,"output":"... | 结果：5/5 通过","output_sha256":"100615a80a05ac9376824961d017895088176117da95616b2ed99b1f18419cf1","summary":"结果：5/5 通过"}
```

复核行只填 `EV-01`。检查器从证据行对应的 `evidence/ev-runs.log` 读取记录，重算输出 SHA-256，并核对 exit=0、记录 HEAD 等于批次被测 commit、执行时间不早于批次生成日期、账本输出摘要等于记录摘要。

